OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day with showers or at
OL,6,Ftimes longer spells of rain over
OL,7,FOrkney at first, which will spread to
OL,8,FShetland later. Winds becoming strong
OL,9,Flater.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be mostly
OL,12,Fcloudy with showers spreading
OL,13,Feastwards, some of these may be heavy.
OL,14,FShowers continuing overnight. Strong
OL,15,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA mostly cloudy morning with
OL,18,Fshowers. Cloudy in the afternoon with
OL,19,Fa heavier band of rain spreading
OL,20,Fsoutheastwards. Strong winds will ease
OL,21,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
